<template>
  <section class="editor">
    <h3>主页模板</h3><p class="hint">一个主页选择一个模板；通用适合各行业，行业模板调整栏目名称与风格，都使用你填写的真实资料。切换后发布才更新公开页面。</p>
    <div class="templates"><article v-for="t in templates" :key="t.code" :class="{selected:form.template===t.code}"><label class="check"><input type="radio" name="template" :value="t.code" v-model="form.template"/>{{ t.name }}</label><div class="mini" :style="{borderColor:t.config?.accent}"><strong>{{ t.config?.intro||'企业介绍' }}</strong><p>{{ t.config?.services||'产品与服务' }} · {{ t.config?.faq||'常见问题' }}</p></div><button :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('preview',t.code)">预览此模板</button></article></div>
    <section class="ai-help"><div><h3>不知道怎么写？让AI整理文案</h3><p>先填写真实的企业介绍、产品或服务信息。AI可整理介绍、产品服务与问答，核对建议后自行采用，不自动保存或发布。</p></div><button :disabled="busy||generating" @click="generate">{{ generating?'正在整理…':'AI整理文案' }}</button></section><p v-if="error" role="alert" class="error">{{ error }}</p>
    <section><div class="head"><div><h3>实际提供的产品与服务</h3><p class="hint">每项产品或服务单独填写，说明提供什么、适合谁及适用条件；这里无需填写资质来源。</p></div><button :disabled="form.service_items.length>=20" @click="form.service_items.push({name:'',description:''})">＋ 添加产品或服务</button></div><p v-if="!form.service_items.length" class="empty">填写实际提供的产品或服务，也可让AI根据已有介绍整理。</p>
      <article v-for="(s,i) in form.service_items" :key="i" class="entry"><div class="head"><strong>产品或服务 {{ Number(i)+1 }}</strong><button class="remove" :aria-label="'删除服务'+(Number(i)+1)" @click="form.service_items.splice(i,1)">删除</button></div><label>产品或服务名称<input v-model="s.name" maxlength="120" placeholder="填写产品或服务的实际名称"/></label><label>产品或服务说明<textarea v-model="s.description" maxlength="6000" rows="3" placeholder="填写实际内容、适用对象与条件，不确定的信息可先不写。"/></label></article><small>最多20条，模块总计不超过6000字。</small>
    </section>
    <section><div class="head"><div><h3>常见问题与回答</h3><p class="hint">一个问题对应一个回答，只回答已确认的信息。例如“如何咨询？”“通过本页公开联系信息咨询”。</p></div><button :disabled="form.faq_items.length>=20" @click="form.faq_items.push({question:'',answer:''})">＋ 添加问答</button></div><p v-if="!form.faq_items.length" class="empty">把客户常问的问题写在这里，让人和AI都更容易找到答案。</p>
      <article v-for="(f,i) in form.faq_items" :key="i" class="entry"><div class="head"><strong>问答 {{ Number(i)+1 }}</strong><button class="remove" :aria-label="'删除问答'+(Number(i)+1)" @click="form.faq_items.splice(i,1)">删除</button></div><label>问题<input v-model="f.question" maxlength="200" placeholder="客户想了解什么？"/></label><label>回答<textarea v-model="f.answer" maxlength="6000" rows="3" placeholder="根据已确认的资料回答，未知内容不要推测。"/></label></article><small>最多20条，模块总计不超过6000字。原有段落完整保留，可手动拆分或让AI整理。</small>
    </section>
    <section><div class="head"><div><h3>公开封面（可选）</h3><p class="hint">看图选择素材，仅使用有权公开的图片。主页撤回或下架后停止公开访问。</p></div><button @click="openPicker">{{ form.cover_asset_id?'更换封面':'选择图片' }}</button></div><div v-if="form.cover_asset_id" class="cover"><img v-if="selectedCover" :src="selectedCover.file_url||selectedCover.thumbnail_url" :alt="selectedCover.name"/><span>{{ selectedCover?.name||'所选封面暂不可用，请重新选择' }}</span><button @click="form.cover_asset_id='';selectedCover=null">移除封面</button></div><p v-else class="empty">未选择封面</p></section>
    <section><details><summary><strong>资质、承诺与有效期（选填）</strong><span class="hint"> · {{ form.facts.length?'已添加 '+form.facts.length+' 项':'普通产品或服务介绍无需填写' }}</span></summary><p>“产品与服务”说明你提供什么；这里补充重要声明的依据、来源或有效期，帮助客户了解适用条件。没有这类信息可以留空。</p><div class="example"><strong>填写示例（不代表本企业实际情况）</strong><p>名称：信息适用条件<br/>内容：本页产品或服务说明供咨询参考，具体内容与适用条件以双方确认为准<br/>依据：本企业对外信息说明，由负责人确认<br/>有效期：长期有效可留空；限时活动请填截止日期</p></div><p class="hint">信息来源可写企业制度、证书名称或官方说明链接，无需上传证件，不要填写敏感证件号码。新增后需确认真实；过期信息请更新或移除后再发布。</p>
      <article v-for="(f,i) in form.facts" :key="i" class="entry"><div class="head"><strong>补充信息 {{ Number(i)+1 }}</strong><button class="remove" @click="form.facts.splice(i,1)">移除补充信息</button></div><div class="grid"><label>声明名称<input v-model="f.key" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如：信息适用条件"/></label><label>内容<input v-model="f.value" maxlength="1000" placeholder="具体内容与适用条件"/></label><label>依据 / 信息来源<input v-model="f.source" maxlength="500" placeholder="企业规则、证书名称或公开说明链接"/></label><label>有效期（可选）<input type="date" v-model="f.valid_until" @change="f.valid_until=f.valid_until||null"/></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" :checked="f.status==='confirmed'" @change="f.status=($event.target as HTMLInputElement).checked?'confirmed':'pending'"/> 企业确认真实</label></article><button :disabled="form.facts.length>=30" @click="form.facts.push({key:'',value:'',source:'',status:'pending',valid_until:null})">＋ 添加补充信息</button></details>
    </section>
    <dialog ref="picker" @close="zoom=null"><div class="head"><h2>选择公开封面</h2><button @click="picker?.close()">关闭</button></div><p class="hint">点击图片查看大图，再选择“用作封面”。支持JPG、PNG和WebP。</p><form class="actions" @submit.prevent="assetPage=1;loadAssets()"><input v-model="assetQuery" aria-label="搜索素材图片" maxlength="100" placeholder="搜索图片名称或标签"/><button :disabled="assetLoading">搜索</button></form><p v-if="assetError" class="error">{{ assetError }}</p><p v-if="assetLoading">正在加载…</p><template v-else><div v-if="zoom"><img class="zoom" :src="zoom.file_url||zoom.thumbnail_url" :alt="zoom.name"/><p>{{ zoom.name }}</p><div class="actions"><button @click="zoom=null">返回图片列表</button><button class="primary" @click="choose(zoom)">用作封面</button></div></div><div v-else class="images"><article v-for="a in assets" :key="a.id" :class="{selected:form.cover_asset_id===a.id}"><button class="image" :aria-label="'预览图片：'+a.name" @click="zoom=a"><img :src="a.thumbnail_url||a.file_url" :alt="a.name" loading="lazy"/></button><p :title="a.name">{{ a.name }}</p><button @click="choose(a)">{{ form.cover_asset_id===a.id?'已选为封面':'用作封面' }}</button></article></div><p v-if="!assets.length&&!zoom" class="empty">暂无可用图片，请调整搜索或先到素材库上传。</p></template><div class="actions"><button :disabled="assetPage===1||assetLoading" @click="assetPage--;loadAssets()">上一页</button><span>第 {{ assetPage }} / {{ Math.max(1,Math.ceil(assetTotal/20)) }} 页</span><button :disabled="assetPage*20>=assetTotal||assetLoading" @click="assetPage++;loadAssets()">下一页</button></div></dialog>
    <dialog ref="aiDialog"><div class="head"><h2>AI文案建议</h2><button @click="aiDialog?.close()">暂不采用</button></div><p class="hint">请逐项核对事实。采用会替换对应模块，未勾选的内容保持原样，不自动保存或发布。</p><template v-if="suggestions"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" v-model="accept.description"/> 采用企业介绍</label><p class="suggested">{{ suggestions.description||'未生成介绍' }}</p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" v-model="accept.services"/> 采用产品与服务条目（{{ suggestions.service_items.length }} 项）</label><article v-for="(s,i) in suggestions.service_items" :key="i" class="entry"><strong>{{ s.name }}</strong><p>{{ s.description }}</p></article><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" v-model="accept.faq"/> 采用问答（{{ suggestions.faq_items.length }} 项）</label><article v-for="(f,i) in suggestions.faq_items" :key="i" class="entry"><strong>{{ f.question }}</strong><p>{{ f.answer }}</p></article><button class="primary" :disabled="!accept.description&&!accept.services&&!accept.faq" @click="applyAI">采用勾选内容</button></template></dialog>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,watch} from 'vue'
import api from '@/api/client'
import {geoPayload} from './geoEditor'
const props=defineProps<{form:any,templates:any[],companyId:string,busy:boolean}>()
const emit=defineEmits<{preview:[code:string],applied:[]}>()
const picker=ref<HTMLDialogElement>(),aiDialog=ref<HTMLDialogElement>(),assets=ref<any[]>([]),selectedCover=ref<any>(null),assetQuery=ref(''),assetPage=ref(1),assetTotal=ref(0),assetError=ref(''),assetLoading=ref(false),zoom=ref<any>(null),generating=ref(false),error=ref(''),suggestions=ref<any>(null),accept=ref({description:false,services:false,faq:false})
function msg(e:any){return typeof e.response?.data?.detail==='string'?e.response.data.detail:e.response?'资料不完整或超过字数上限，请检查后重试':e.message||'操作失败，请重试'}
async function openPicker(){picker.value?.showModal();assetPage.value=1;await loadAssets()}
async function loadAssets(){assetLoading.value=true;assetError.value='';zoom.value=null;try{const r=await api.get(`/companies/${props.companyId}/assets`,{params:{asset_type:'image',page:assetPage.value,page_size:20,q:assetQuery.value||undefined}});assets.value=(r.data.items||[]).filter((a:any)=>['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'].includes(a.mime_type));assetTotal.value=r.data.total||0}catch(e:any){assets.value=[];assetError.value=msg(e)}finally{assetLoading.value=false}}
function choose(a:any){props.form.cover_asset_id=a.id;selectedCover.value=a;picker.value?.close()}
async function generate(){if(generating.value)return;generating.value=true;error.value='';const id=props.companyId;try{const r=await api.post(`/companies/${id}/geo/ai-draft`,geoPayload(props.form),{timeout:100000});if(id!==props.companyId)return;suggestions.value=r.data;accept.value={description:false,services:false,faq:false};aiDialog.value?.showModal()}catch(e:any){error.value=msg(e)}finally{generating.value=false}}
function applyAI(){const s=suggestions.value;if(accept.value.description)props.form.description=s.description;if(accept.value.services)props.form.service_items=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(s.service_items));if(accept.value.faq)props.form.faq_items=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(s.faq_items));props.form.confirmed=false;aiDialog.value?.close();emit('applied')}
watch(()=>props.form.cover_asset_id,async id=>{if(!id){selectedCover.value=null;return}if(selectedCover.value?.id===id)return;try{const r=await api.get(`/companies/${props.companyId}/assets/${id}`);if(props.form.cover_asset_id===id)selectedCover.value=r.data}catch{selectedCover.value=null}},{immediate:true})
</script>
<style scoped>
.editor section{margin-top:28px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #e3e7dd}h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 10px}h2{font-size:21px}p{line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.hint,small{color:#68746c;font-size:13px}.head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.head>div{flex:1;min-width:0}.head>button{flex-shrink:0}.head p{margin:0 0 10px}.entry{border:1px solid #dfe5d8;background:#fafbf8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0}.entry p,.suggested{white-space:pre-wrap}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 16px}label{display:block;font-size:14px;margin:14px 0}input,textarea{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:7px;border:1px solid #cbd3ca;border-radius:7px;font:inherit;background:#fff;color:#26332f}textarea{resize:vertical}.check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.check input{width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;flex-shrink:0}button{border:1px solid #cbd3ca;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 14px;background:white;color:#26332f;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:13px}button:hover{border-color:#b44d25;background:#fff8f1}.remove{color:#a63428;padding:6px 12px;align-self:flex-start;border-color:#e5c9c1}.primary{background:#b44d25;color:white;border-color:#b44d25}button.primary:hover{background:#933d1c}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.empty{padding:20px;border:1px dashed #d8dfd2;border-radius:9px;color:#68746c;background:#f8f9f5;font-size:14px}.ai-help{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;background:#fff8ef!important;padding:20px!important;border:1px solid #ead5c2!important;border-radius:10px}.ai-help div{flex:1}.ai-help p{font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#78644d}.ai-help button{flex-shrink:0}.templates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:16px}.templates article{border:1px solid #d8dfd2;border-radius:10px;padding:16px}.templates label{margin-top:0;font-weight:600}.selected{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #b44d25;border-color:#b44d25!important}.mini{padding:14px;border-left:3px solid;background:#f5f4ee;border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px}.mini p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#68746c;font-size:12px}.cover{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}.cover img{width:180px;height:108px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px}.cover span{flex:1;min-width:120px}summary{cursor:pointer;line-height:1.8}.example{border-left:3px solid #b68e60;background:#f6f4ec;padding:14px 18px;font-size:13px}.example p{margin-bottom:0}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}.actions input{flex:1;width:auto;min-width:120px;margin:0}dialog{box-sizing:border-box;width:min(860px,calc(100vw - 28px));max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;padding:24px;border:1px solid #d8dfd2;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:#26332f}dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(20,30,25,.5)}.images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:20px}.images article{min-width:0;border:1px solid #d8dfd2;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;padding-bottom:12px}.images article>p{white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin:8px 12px;font-size:13px}.images article>button:last-child{margin-left:12px}.image{display:block;width:100%;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#f4f5ef}.image img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;display:block}.zoom{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:48vh;object-fit:contain;margin:20px auto}.error{color:#b42318}@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.head,.ai-help{flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}.head>div{flex-basis:65%}.images{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.templates{grid-template-columns:1fr}dialog{padding:18px}.cover img{width:100%;height:170px}}
</style>
